    "sentence_translations": [
      "Little Ming the Casanova",
      "",
      "One day, the school had a meeting with all students.",
      "The teacher wanted Little Ming to count if all the female students were present or not, ..",
      ".. and said to Little Ming: “Little Ming, go count all the female students.”",
      "",
      "Little Ming was thrilled, and whispered: “Who should I kiss first?”",
      "",
      "The teacher thought for a while, then said: “In student number order of course!”",
      "",
      "Little Ming was even more thrilled, and ran over and kissed the girl with student number 01\u0010, the most beautiful girl in the class, ..",
      ".. and got punched by that girl.",
      "",
      "The teacher got angry too, and said to Little Ming: “Little Ming, I'm telling you to count them, not kiss them!”"
    ]
  }
